{
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.0-0r.char": "以正确之名，我在此宣告 —— \n你，就是这个世界一切恶的源头。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.0-1r.ancient": "正确？\n你是来这里审判我的吗，小姑娘。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.0-2r.char": "不是审判，是纠正。\n这高塔、这腐化、你建立的这整套错误的秩序——我要让它全部归于正确的形态。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.0-3r.ancient": "回塔底去吧，执迷不悟的小鬼。\n你的[jitter][red]“正确”[/red][/jitter]，在我这里一文不值。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.1-0r.char": "我回来了。\n这一次，我必将完成这场审判。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.1-1r.ancient": "又是你？\n靠着死亡重来的能力，一次次爬到这里，不觉得可悲么？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.1-2r.char": "无论重来多少次，我都会站在这里。\n你的恶行，终将被清算。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.1-3r.ancient": "你所谓的正义，\n不过是用无数次死亡堆出来的独善其身。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.1-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-0r.char": "你定义了这个世界的秩序，\n却放任混乱与杀戮滋生。你，才是最该被处刑的罪人。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-1r.ancient": "你又懂什么是秩序？\n你连自己的[jitter][red]“正确”[/red][/jitter]都守不住，也配来指责我？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-2r.char": "我不会再让任何生命，\n因你的傲慢与偏执白白死去。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-3r.ancient": "呵。\n你和那个给我下毒的女人，一样的愚蠢，一样的不自量力。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-4r.char": "你的罪，将由我亲手裁定。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-4r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-5r.ancient": "那就让我看看，\n你这所谓的裁决，有没有能伤到我的重量。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.2-5r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.3-0r.char": "……",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.3-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.3-1r.ancient": "连辩词都穷尽了么。\n还是说，你终于明白[jitter][red]言语毫无意义[/red][/jitter]了。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.3-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.3-2r.char": "……来吧。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.3-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.3-3r.ancient": "这就对了。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.3-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NIKAIDO_HIRO.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HIKAMI_MERURU.0-0r.char": "求求您……帮帮我。\n您一定能把她带回来的，对不对？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HIKAMI_MERURU.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HIKAMI_MERURU.0-1r.ancient": "又是一个为了执念，\n把双手染满鲜血的小鬼。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HIKAMI_MERURU.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HIKAMI_MERURU.0-2r.char": "我只是想再见到大魔女大人……\n哪怕付出任何代价都可以。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HIKAMI_MERURU.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HIKAMI_MERURU.0-3r.ancient": "被抛弃的滋味不好受吧？\n我从不会为愚蠢的执念，修复早已破碎的过往。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HIKAMI_MERURU.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HIKAMI_MERURU.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-0r.char": "哇啊——终于到了！\n这里就是塔的最顶端？\n空气好干燥，诺亚不太喜欢这里——",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-1r.ancient": "……又一个对造物一无所知的人站在了我面前。\n你是谁？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-2r.char": "诺亚是艺术家！听说你创造了这整个世界……\n那些东西也是你画的吗？\n你是怎么画出完美作品的？\n教教诺亚——",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-3r.ancient": "造物不是儿戏。\n你以为它是画布上的涂鸦？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-4r.char": "诺亚才不是在涂鸦！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-4r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-5r.ancient": "……毁灭你的认知并非我的目的。\n离开。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-5r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-JOGASAKI_NOAH.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TACHIBANA_SHERRY.0-0r.char": "哇！原来你就是这个塔的幕后真凶对吧？\n名侦探雪莉，终于找到案件的真相啦！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TACHIBANA_SHERRY.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TACHIBANA_SHERRY.0-1r.ancient": "真相不过是小鬼为了找乐子，\n拼凑出来的无聊戏码。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TACHIBANA_SHERRY.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TACHIBANA_SHERRY.0-2r.char": "才不是无聊戏码！\n这可是史上最棒的案件啊！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TACHIBANA_SHERRY.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TACHIBANA_SHERRY.0-3r.ancient": "回塔底去吧。\n我的造物，从不是给你取乐的玩具。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TACHIBANA_SHERRY.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TACHIBANA_SHERRY.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAEKI_MIRIA.0-0r.char": "啊哈哈……大叔我不太习惯这种场面。\n别这样直勾勾地盯着我啊。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAEKI_MIRIA.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAEKI_MIRIA.0-1r.ancient": "……奇怪的伪装、安定的灵魂、自我标榜的无害。\n你很有趣。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAEKI_MIRIA.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAEKI_MIRIA.0-2r.char": "有趣什么的……大叔这种小角色，你注意不到的。\n就当没看见我，好不好？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAEKI_MIRIA.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAEKI_MIRIA.0-3r.ancient": "下次吧。\n或许。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAEKI_MIRIA.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAEKI_MIRIA.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TONO_HANNA.0-0r.char": "身为一名合格的大小姐，在谈判前理应先以优雅的姿态致意……\n你可以叫我汉娜。请问，你就是这座塔的'主人'吗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TONO_HANNA.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TONO_HANNA.0-1r.ancient": "名门千金？\n不过是用谎言编织的、自欺欺人的幻梦罢了。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TONO_HANNA.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TONO_HANNA.0-2r.char": "……无礼之徒！\n难道你听不见一位淑女在向你问好吗！？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TONO_HANNA.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TONO_HANNA.0-3r.ancient": "回塔底去吧。\n我从不会为逃避现实的小鬼，捏造虚假的圆满。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TONO_HANNA.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TONO_HANNA.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HASUMI_LEIA.0-0r.char": "我来此，是为了向你索要独属于我的聚光灯。\n这个世界的造物主，理应给最耀眼的主角，应得的注视。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HASUMI_LEIA.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HASUMI_LEIA.0-1r.ancient": "演员？这里没有观众，没有掌声，也没有人注视着你。\n你在这里没有任何意义。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HASUMI_LEIA.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HASUMI_LEIA.0-2r.char": "我不需要观众。\n这座塔剥夺了我的一切，却始终夺不走我的身心。\n我的存在本身，就是一座足以让你移不开目光的舞台。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HASUMI_LEIA.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HASUMI_LEIA.0-3r.ancient": "……真是可悲的执念。\n你以为仅凭自信就能撼动这高塔的秩序？\n你的光芒在这里毫无价值。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HASUMI_LEIA.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HASUMI_LEIA.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-KUROBE_NANOKA.0-0r.char": "我看过你的过去，\n也看过你造的这场杀戮轮回。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-KUROBE_NANOKA.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-KUROBE_NANOKA.0-1r.ancient": "一个靠着窥探记忆苟活的小鬼，\n也敢对我创造的秩序指手画脚？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-KUROBE_NANOKA.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-KUROBE_NANOKA.0-2r.char": "这一枪，\n我会终结所有被定好的结局。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-KUROBE_NANOKA.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-KUROBE_NANOKA.0-3r.ancient": "那就让我看看，你这颗子弹，\n能不能击穿我定下的过去与未来。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-KUROBE_NANOKA.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-KUROBE_NANOKA.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HOSHO_MAGO.0-0r.char": "哎呀呀，这就是创造了整个世界的神明吗？\n真是意外的平平无奇呢。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HOSHO_MAGO.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HOSHO_MAGO.0-1r.ancient": "满口谎言的小鬼，\n连自己的心都骗不过，\n也配来嘲弄我？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HOSHO_MAGO.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HOSHO_MAGO.0-2r.char": "毕竟这个世界上，\n本来就没有什么真心可言呀。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HOSHO_MAGO.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HOSHO_MAGO.0-3r.ancient": "你所谓的爱，不过是拙劣模仿的占有欲。\n回塔底去吧，欺诈师。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-HOSHO_MAGO.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NATSUME_ANAN.0-0r.char": "吾辈在此恳求，\n你能否抹除这诅咒般的魔法，让吾从囚笼中解脱。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NATSUME_ANAN.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NATSUME_ANAN.0-1r.ancient": "如今又想抹掉自己犯下的罪孽？\n真是可笑。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NATSUME_ANAN.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NATSUME_ANAN.0-2r.char": "吾辈只是……\n不想再让任何人变得不幸了。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NATSUME_ANAN.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NATSUME_ANAN.0-3r.ancient": "连直面过往的勇气都没有，也配来向我索求解脱？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NATSUME_ANAN.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-NATSUME_ANAN.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SHITO_ALISA.0-0r.char": "喂，站那么高的那个。\n这破塔是你造的？\n你就是那个所谓的'造物主'？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SHITO_ALISA.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SHITO_ALISA.0-1r.ancient": "你也好，这座塔也好，都一个样。\n总是带着那么多的愤怒和困惑找上门来。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SHITO_ALISA.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SHITO_ALISA.0-2r.char": "少废话。\n要么现在就揍扁我，要么就被我烧成灰烬，少在那里说些恶心的漂亮话。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SHITO_ALISA.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SHITO_ALISA.0-3r.ancient": "想要审判的话，你找错地方了。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SHITO_ALISA.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SHITO_ALISA.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAKURABA_EMA.0-0r.char": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAKURABA_EMA.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAKURABA_EMA.0-1r.ancient": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAKURABA_EMA.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAWATARI_COCO.0-0r.char": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAWATARI_COCO.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAWATARI_COCO.0-1r.ancient": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-SAWATARI_COCO.0-attack": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TSUKISHIRO_YUKI.0-0r.char": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TSUKISHIRO_YUKI.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TSUKISHIRO_YUKI.0-1r.ancient": "...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MANOSABA-TSUKISHIRO_YUKI.0-attack": "..."
}
